  - id: CLUE_SANDBOX_NOTE
    title: "T\u1EDD gi\u1EA5y trong t\u1EE7"
    body: "H\xE0 N\u1ED9i, n\u0103m 2004. Nam \u1EDF c\xF9ng Bia, B\u0103ng v\xE0 B\u1EA3o trong c\u0103n nh\xE0 b\xE0 h\u1ECD h\xE0ng cho thu\xEA.\n\nL\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFn c\u1EE7a Bia: Xu\u1ED1ng \u0103n c\u01A1m nh\xE9. Ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch \u1EDF t\u1EA7ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi. Ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD cu\u1ED1i h\xE0nh lang t\u1EA7ng n\xE0y, nh\u1EDB gi\u1EEF y\xEAn t\u0129nh."
  - id: CLUE_SANDBOX_SIGN
    title: "B\u1EA3ng tin h\xE0nh lang"
    body: "Ph\xF2ng ng\u1EE7 \u2192 h\xE0nh lang t\u1EA7ng 2 \u2192 c\u1EA7u thang \u2192 ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch.\n\nT\u1EEB c\u1EA7u thang l\xEAn t\u1EA7ng 2, \u0111i h\u1EBFt h\xE0nh lang l\xE0 ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD. K\xFD hi\u1EC7u d\xF2ng h\u1ECD tr\xEAn c\u1EEDa ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD gi\u1ED1ng v\u1EADt h\u1ED9 th\xE2n c\u1EE7a Nam."
  - id: DEMO_BOWL_CLUE
    title: "Chi\u1EBFc b\xE1t th\u1EE9 n\u0103m"
    body: "B\u1ED1n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0103n c\u01A1m nh\u01B0ng tr\xEAn m\xE2m c\xF3 n\u0103m chi\u1EBFc b\xE1t. Chi\u1EBFc b\xE1t nh\u1ECF c\xF3 hoa v\u0103n tr\u1EBB con. Ch\u01B0a ai nh\u1EADn \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EB7t n\xF3 l\xEAn m\xE2m."
  - id: DEMO_MIRROR_CLUE
    title: "B\xF3ng trong g\u01B0\u01A1ng"
    body: "Nam v\u1EEBa r\u1EEDa m\u1EB7t th\xEC th\u1EA5y b\xF3ng m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF ph\xEDa sau. Quay l\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ai. D\u01B0\u1EDBi m\xE9p g\u01B0\u01A1ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u b\xE0n tay nh\u1ECF."
  - id: DEMO_SHRINE_CLUE
    title: "K\xFD hi\u1EC7u d\xF2ng h\u1ECD"
    body: "K\xFD hi\u1EC7u tr\xEAn \u0111\u1ED3 th\u1EDD gi\u1ED1ng v\u1EADt h\u1ED9 th\xE2n c\u1EE7a Nam. C\u0103n ph\xF2ng y\xEAn t\u0129nh kh\xE1c th\u01B0\u1EDDng. Nam ghi nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EEB ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch l\xEAn \u0111\xE2y."
  - id: PROLOGUE_DOG_CLUE
    title: "Ti\u1EBFng ch\xF3 \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF5"
    body: "[Ch\xF3 s\u1EE7a li\xEAn h\u1ED3i]\n\nC\u1EA3 nh\xF3m v\u1EEBa \u0111i ngang \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF5 th\xEC con ch\xF3 b\u1EADt d\u1EADy s\u1EE7a. Nam ngo\xE1i nh\xECn, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng r\xF5 n\xF3 \u0111ang nh\xECn ai. Bia g\u1ECDi m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i ti\u1EBFp."
  dialogues:
  - id: DIALOGUE_SANDBOX_FRIEND
    speaker: Bia
    lines:
    - "M\u1EA5y \u0111\u1EE9a xu\u1ED1ng ph\xF2ng kh\xE1ch r\u1ED3i. T\xECm ch\xECa m\u1EDF t\u1EE7 l\u1EA5y l\u1EDDi nh\u1EAFn \u0111i."
    - "B\xE0 d\u1EB7n ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD \u1EDF cu\u1ED1i h\xE0nh lang, \u0111\u1EEBng b\xE0y \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u1EAFn c\u1EEDa nh\xE9."
  - id: DEMO_GAME_DIALOGUE
    speaker: "Bia \xB7 B\u0103ng \xB7 B\u1EA3o"
    lines:
    - "B\u1ED1n \u0111\u1EE9a th\u1EED V\u1ED7 Vai Ma nh\xE9? M\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EE9ng m\u1ED9t g\xF3c, t\u1EAFt \u0111\xE8n r\u1ED3i l\u1EA7n l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111i v\u1ED7 vai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\u1EBF ti\u1EBFp."
    - "\u0110\u1EBFn g\xF3c \u0111\xE3 tr\u1ED1ng th\xEC d\u1EEBng. C\xF3 b\u1ED1n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\xF4i, l\xE0m sao c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u1EDF \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c..."
    - "N\u1EBFu c\xF3 chuy\u1EC7n, \u0111\u1EEBng ch\u1EA1y ra ng\xF5. Nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xEAn ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD t\u1EA7ng 2. Khi b\u1ECB truy \u0111u\u1ED5i, ch\u1ECDn sai h\u01B0\u1EDBng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EBFt."
  - id: PROLOGUE_GROUP_DIALOGUE
    speaker: "Bia \xB7 B\u0103ng \xB7 B\u1EA3o"
    lines:
    - "Bia: L\u1EA7n n\xE0o \u0111i qua \u0111\xE2y n\xF3 c\u0169ng s\u1EE7a. Th\xF4i v\u1EC1 \u0111i, \u0111\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE2y n\u1EEFa tr\u1EDDi t\u1ED1i m\u1EA5t."
    - "B\u1EA3o: Nh\xE0 b\xE0 h\u1ECD h\xE0ng c\u1EE7a Nam cho thu\xEA r\u1EBB th\u1EBF n\xE0y l\xE0 may r\u1ED3i. \u1EDE m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi gian c\u0169ng quen."
    - "Nam: B\xE0 nh\u1EDD m\xECnh tr\xF4ng nh\xE0 h\u1ED9. C\xF3 ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD ri\xEAng, b\xE0 d\u1EB7n \u0111\u1EEBng b\xE0y \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u1EAFn l\u1ED1i."
    - "B\u0103ng: V\u1EC1 c\xF2n \u0103n c\u01A1m. H\xF4m nay \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t ai r\u1EEDa b\xE1t \u1EA5y nh\u1EC9?"
